OL,3,AWhat will the energy cap changes mean  
OL,4,Afor my bills?                          
OL,6,FEnergy bills are to soar in January, as
OL,7,Fprices governed by regulator Ofgem's   
OL,8,Fcap rise at the coldest time of the    
OL,9,Fyear.                                  
OL,11,FThe cap affects millions of people in  
OL,12,FEngland, Scotland and Wales, and       
OL,13,Freflects higher wholesale gas costs    
OL,14,Fwhich have been pushed up by the       
OL,15,FUS-Israel war with Iran.               
OL,17,FIt means people on variable tariffs    
OL,18,Fshould give an accurate meter reading, 
OL,19,Fensure they are receiving all the      
OL,20,Fsupport to which they are entitled, and
OL,21,Ftake care over energy use.             
