OL,3,AWhat will the energy cap changes mean  
OL,4,Afor my bills?                          
OL,6,FThe energy cap fixes the maximum amount
OL,7,Fwhich customers on standard variable   
OL,8,Ftariffs can be charged for each unit of
OL,9,Fgas and electricity used.              
